    {
      "id": "e1121aab-8fb6-4767-8717-29d458e3d618",
      "content": "English: Aram Naharaim | French: Aram-des-deux-Fleuves | Latin: Aram Naharaim | Origin: &#1488;&#1458;&#1512;&#1463;&#1501; &#1504;&#1463;&#1492;&#1458;&#1512;&#1463;&#1497;&#1477;&#1501; | Vietnamese: A-ram Na-ha-ra-gim -- xứ sở cũ của ông Áp-ra-ham, St 24,2-10",
      "kind": "MARK_KIND_FOOTNOTE",
      "label": "3",
      "sortOrder": 2,
