      "id": "8642c7f8-651b-433f-8af6-799dfcd1d06b",
      "content": "English: Ephraim Gate | French: Ephraim -- (porte d) | Latin: Ephraim (porta) | Origin: &#1488;&#1462;&#1508;&#1456;&#1512;&#1463;&#1497;&#1477;&#1501; &#8206;(&#64298;&#1463;&#1506;&#1463;&#1512;) | Vietnamese: Ép-ra-im (cửa) -- một cửa phía bắc tường thành Giê-ru-sa-lem, -- 2 V 14,13 ; 2 Sb 25,23",
