    {
      "id": "4ccaffa8-3fc9-4063-894c-72e07853e6e3",
      "content": "English: Manasseh | French: Manassé | Latin: Manasse | Origin: &#1502;&#1456;&#1504;&#1463;&#64298;&#1468;&#1462;&#1492; | Vietnamese: Mơ-na-se 2 -- vua Giu-đa, Gr 15,4 ; 1 Sb 3,13",
